GhostFrag 附属包 (DirtyFrag companion)
=======================================

This module is an import of the DirtyFrag application:
https://github.com/mitschud/DirtyFrag

It is licensed under GPL-2.0-only; see LICENSE in this directory. The module is
built as a separate APK with applicationId `df.root` and is not linked into the
GhostLock APK (applicationId `com.ghostlock.app`). GhostLock only detects and
launches it through an explicit Intent.

Upstream chain and credits as recorded by the DirtyFrag README:

- Upstream project and exploit chain: https://github.com/diabl0w/DFRoot
- Original PoC and related code: https://github.com/lsposed/lspromise
- SELinux permissive kernel modules and related code:
  https://github.com/polygraphene/DFReroot
- Unprivileged XFRM socket method: https://github.com/combeng6th/DirtyInit

The eight prebuilt LKMs under `src/main/jni/ko/` are imported unchanged. They
embed `/data/user_de/0/df.root/...` paths, which is why this module keeps the
original package name.
